{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 38,
    "dDurationMs": 3581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am here to sign a\ndocument betting $10,000"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3619,
    "dDurationMs": 4331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that my last video is in fact, correct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7950,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the video in question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10380,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people may have missed it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11620,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but in this car, there is\nno motor, no batteries,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15140,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no energy source, besides the wind itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18170,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the counterintuitive claim,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19370,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that this car can maintain speeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22320,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faster than the wind that's pushing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25100,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is a physics professor at UCLA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28480,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who got in touch, to say that\nhe thought that I was wrong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31620,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the explanation was wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33800,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, we went back\nand forth a little bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35300,
    "dDurationMs": 1607,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and eventually I said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36907,
    "dDurationMs": 3214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Well, how about we bet $10,000?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40121,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I can prove it to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41747,
    "dDurationMs": 3743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"This vehicle really can go\ndownwind faster than the wind.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45490,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to my surprise, he is\ntaking me up on the bet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48490,
    "dDurationMs": 1759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Look, no one is perfect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50249,
    "dDurationMs": 3311,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you have a much lower error rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53560,
    "dDurationMs": 2990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than most people on\nYouTube, in YouTube Space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56550,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, Professor Alex\nKusenko wanted this wager"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59000,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and all related discourse to be public."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61330,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, he suggested we get a celebrity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63230,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to witness the signing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64480,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I asked Neil deGrasse Tyson, Bill Nye,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66980,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Sean Carroll to be our witnesses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68750,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they graciously agreed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70580,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And Alex, I just wanna say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72510,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I agree with everything\nyou said about Veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75540,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That generally I can watch it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78730,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not have to wonder,\nis he gonna mess up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81670,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How am I gonna-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82503,
    "dDurationMs": 2147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No, he's brilliant, no, he's brilliant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84650,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I'm excited about this bet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85960,
    "dDurationMs": 2352,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because if I am wrong, then I wanna know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88312,
    "dDurationMs": 3028,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the whole point of the\nchannel is to get to the truth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91340,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is, I think why\nwe're all here today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93670,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94503,
    "dDurationMs": 1887,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is a great chance to sort of see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96390,
    "dDurationMs": 2742,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to summarize Alex's\nmain points in this video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99132,
    "dDurationMs": 2838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I'll put his full presentation here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101970,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So let me first explain\nwhat I see in the video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106020,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the video, the vehicle\nis operated in a gusty wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110840,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Initially, you have the wind\nspeed exceeding the car speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115430,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then the wind speed is not constant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117110,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The wind speed drops, and\nthe car moves by inertia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121360,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with deceleration for awhile."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123510,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, basically Alex thinks a gust"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125640,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pushes the car to a high speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127240,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then when the wind dies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128590,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the car is going faster\nthan the wind momentarily,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131390,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it must be slowing down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133480,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In fact, that will be my conclusion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134850,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the end of this presentation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136330,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that whenever you have\nvelocity faster than the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138900,
    "dDurationMs": 1748,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll actually show you in an equation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140648,
    "dDurationMs": 1382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the acceleration is negative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142030,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second effect is that\nthe wind in the video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146560,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is measured at the height"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148000,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of about a meter or a meter and a half."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150050,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the propeller goes\nto some three meters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152400,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "above the ground."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153233,
    "dDurationMs": 2007,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, due to interactions\nwith the ground,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155240,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a wind gradient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157090,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wind travels slower, close to the ground,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159350,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then faster, higher up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Alex estimated that the\nwind speed of the propeller"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163590,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "might be 10 or 15% higher\nthan at the tell-tale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167140,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's possible that\nthe car could be moving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169430,
    "dDurationMs": 1715,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slower than the wind at the propeller,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171145,
    "dDurationMs": 2536,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet appear to be\nmoving faster than the wind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173681,
    "dDurationMs": 1779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the height of the tell-tale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175460,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, I think that\nthis is a small effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177890,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, in combination\nwith the previous effect,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180360,
    "dDurationMs": 2792,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just can make this more frequent, okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183152,
    "dDurationMs": 1798,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that completes-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184950,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Alex, if I remember the video correctly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187760,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Derek reports that they've achieved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189820,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up to 2.8 times wind speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192920,
    "dDurationMs": 4390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That feels much higher\nthan what is possible here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197310,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unless the wind had picked up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199060,
    "dDurationMs": 2579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then spontaneously sort of dropped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201639,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Very, very good question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202900,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, if you're going for the record,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205360,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you probably will do many attempts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207970,
    "dDurationMs": 1977,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You will be sampling that gusty wind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209947,
    "dDurationMs": 2203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over, and over, and over,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212150,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until you set the record, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213430,
    "dDurationMs": 1183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's how you set the record."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214613,
    "dDurationMs": 2787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And on one of those occasions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217400,
    "dDurationMs": 1621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you will get a nice strong gust,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219021,
    "dDurationMs": 3999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is three times the air\nthat comes after it, okay?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223020,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's when you will clock the record."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225550,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's where that\n2.8 factor will come in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228730,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So what about the treadmill tests?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230680,
    "dDurationMs": 2464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are conducted in still air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233144,
    "dDurationMs": 2286,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By moving the ground backwards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235430,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're simulating a\nperfectly steady tailwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238770,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you hold the car\nstationary on the treadmill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241800,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, that's equivalent to the\ncar going exactly wind speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245550,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if the car can move\nforward on the treadmill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248730,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that shows it can accelerate\nfaster than the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253100,
    "dDurationMs": 1584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Alex had multiple explanations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254684,
    "dDurationMs": 2756,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why these experiments don't actually show"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257440,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what they claim to show."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259050,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you have this fluctuating\nspeed of the treadmill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264570,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then if a human\njust sort of steers it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267040,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it then can introduce unconsciously,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269390,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bias towards the desired result."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271880,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So, would it any be that\nthe guy with the spork"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275550,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is inducing the model craft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278190,
    "dDurationMs": 2647,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to go across the lane now and then?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280837,
    "dDurationMs": 4089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as you pointed out, I\nwould go downhill now and then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284926,
    "dDurationMs": 2914,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, I'm sure, I'm\na hundred percent sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287840,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the guy in the video\ndoesn't do it on purpose, okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293256,
    "dDurationMs": 4329,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, you know, if he\nis expecting forward drift-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297585,
    "dDurationMs": 1111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, oh he's trying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298696,
    "dDurationMs": 3054,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, yeah absolutely,\nthat's exactly, okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301750,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there you go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302870,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In the absence of convincing\nexperimental evidence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305940,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alex turned to theoretical analyses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308280,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like one by MIT Aero\nProfessor, Mark Drela."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311500,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here too, he found problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314210,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His main concern is that\nthe equation for net force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316610,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "includes the difference\nbetween the speeds of the car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319350,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the wind in the denominator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321890,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which seems to imply that when\ntraveling exactly wind speed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325480,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you should get infinite force."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327600,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now, here's the real danger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329410,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because if Derek drives\nvery close to the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333310,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that difference in speed goes to zero."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336530,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's one millionth of one percent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339200,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's like a nuclear\nbomb exploding behind him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341590,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then Derek is definitely\nin trouble, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343620,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we need to find something\nto save Derek's life here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346960,
    "dDurationMs": 1087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is serious, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348047,
    "dDurationMs": 2803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But dividing by zero, come on, you guys."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350850,
    "dDurationMs": 1119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I never looked at that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351969,
    "dDurationMs": 2275,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Alex performed his own analysis,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354244,
    "dDurationMs": 3506,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and found no such divide by zero problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357750,
    "dDurationMs": 2270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, he found there's\nno way for the car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360020,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to accelerate at, or above wind speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363260,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The acceleration of\nthis craft is negative."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366380,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when we, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368150,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's possible to move the\ncraft faster than the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370360,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's not possible to\nmove it at zero acceleration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373110,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which would be needed to\nmaintain constant speed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376640,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] That is\nbasically where we left it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378390,
    "dDurationMs": 850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That is right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379240,
    "dDurationMs": 1413,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay, thank you, thank you, Neil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380653,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you very much."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381486,
    "dDurationMs": 947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Thanks guys, thanks Neil."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382433,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So now it was up to me to\nconvince Professor Kusenko"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385593,
    "dDurationMs": 3073,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Blackbird really can\ngo faster than the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391598,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I posted about it on Twitter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393077,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alice Zhang, who runs\nChinese Veritasium, said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395744,
    "dDurationMs": 1914,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I think you lost Derek."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397658,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm 80% on Alex's side now.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400228,
    "dDurationMs": 1594,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's amazing to me, is\nthat neither one of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401822,
    "dDurationMs": 3446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had seen my attempts to replicate\nthe treadmill experiments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405268,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For the first video, I asked\nmy friend and YouTube maker,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407848,
    "dDurationMs": 3117,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Xyla Foxlin, to make\na model downwind cart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410965,
    "dDurationMs": 1916,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- All right.\n(wheels screeching)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412881,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414080,
    "dDurationMs": 958,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Man] Oh, no!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415038,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Version one ended in failure,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417228,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Xyla was undeterred,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419068,
    "dDurationMs": 2819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "coming back in a couple\nof days with version two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421887,
    "dDurationMs": 1271,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Is it feeling like it's gonna...?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423158,
    "dDurationMs": 3590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Unlike these models, most\nof her projects actually work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426748,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She is determined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428428,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So maybe this tells us something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430148,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about whether you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431368,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually go faster than\nthe wind, downwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434678,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was clear to me is that\nI didn't do a good enough job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437518,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the first video,\nexplaining how Blackbird works"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440268,
    "dDurationMs": 1357,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and providing convincing evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441625,
    "dDurationMs": 2513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it can really go faster than the wind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444138,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a sustained way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445548,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In my defense, I thought the concept"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447428,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was well enough established."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449188,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Way back in 1969, Andrew Bauer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451648,
    "dDurationMs": 2448,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "build the first successful downwind cart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454096,
    "dDurationMs": 3312,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he did it to settle a friendly wager"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457408,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with Aero Engineer, Apolo Smith."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459768,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The bet was inspired by a\nclaim in a students paper"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462378,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from 20 years earlier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464138,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Rick Cavallaro,\nthe builder of Blackbird"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465918,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was completely unaware of all this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467378,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until after he built his cart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469548,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But other analysis have been published"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471518,
    "dDurationMs": 2498,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under names like the\npush-me pull-you boat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474016,
    "dDurationMs": 2922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I didn't honestly\nthink anyone would doubt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476938,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the vehicles operation,\nmuch less bet me $10,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480908,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But clearly, there is a need\nfor a deeper explanation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484038,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I want to do that now\nby responding to the points"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486678,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alex raised."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487778,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So first, let's deal with wind gradient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490138,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, why didn't we measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491358,
    "dDurationMs": 1518,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the speed of the wind higher up?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492876,
    "dDurationMs": 3302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the answer is because\nit's already been done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496178,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They mounted tell-tales on fishing poles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498308,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out to the sides of the\npropeller and even above it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501248,
    "dDurationMs": 2613,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, although the lowest\ntell-tale flips back first,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503861,
    "dDurationMs": 3237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all of the tell-tales do\neventually flip backwards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507098,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "showing that every part of the vehicle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508892,
    "dDurationMs": 2616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is going faster than the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511508,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could this be because of a big wind gust"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513518,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that pushed the car up to high\nspeed and then the wind died?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516897,
    "dDurationMs": 1591,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think so."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518488,
    "dDurationMs": 2110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even though I didn't have\na speedometer in the car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520598,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for my runs, someone\non Twitter pointed out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522898,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we could use the\nrotation of the back wheel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525128,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to determine the speed\nfrom the video footage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527778,
    "dDurationMs": 2664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This shows that even after\nthe tell-tale flips backwards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530442,
    "dDurationMs": 2269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the car keeps accelerating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534148,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another thing I want to point out is that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535818,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if wind gradient or gusts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537498,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were the reason that the car\ntravels faster than the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540058,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, you'd expect the\ntell-tale to jump around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 542828,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or at least not point straight back at me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545808,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it consistently\ndoes for over 30 seconds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548019,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until I had to hit the brakes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549608,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to avoid crashing into parked vehicles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552278,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if that's not enough for you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553908,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when Blackbird achieved its record speed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555928,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of 27.7 miles per hour in a\n10 mile per hour tail wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560288,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was still accelerating."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562248,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we know this because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563668,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there were multiple GPS units\nin the car and wind speeds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567118,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which were measured at the\nheight of the propeller"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569248,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at multiple locations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571198,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The highlighted section shows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572598,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ten second measurement period"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574038,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over which the record was set."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576738,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also in 2013, the U.S Physics\nOlympiad Semifinal Exam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580768,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "asked questions about Blackbird."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582708,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, can it go faster than\nthe wind downwind and upwind?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587198,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The solution says, both\nmodes are possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590408,
    "dDurationMs": 2315,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with sufficiently low energy loss,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592723,
    "dDurationMs": 2775,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "any speed is possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595498,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I'll admit that the evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597108,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I showed in the first\nvideo was not definitive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 599903,
    "dDurationMs": 1721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when gusts or gradients"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601624,
    "dDurationMs": 2844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could have explained the observations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604468,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now that you've seen this evidence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606398,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are you convinced that\nBlackbird can go downwind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608728,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faster than the wind without slowing down?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611468,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Professor Kusenko was not convinced."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614848,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I wanna explain how\nthe car works so clearly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617588,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that no one, not even the professor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619638,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can doubt what's going on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621638,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first thing to know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622471,
    "dDurationMs": 2677,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the propeller doesn't\nwork like most people think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625148,
    "dDurationMs": 1602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not working like a windmill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626750,
    "dDurationMs": 3408,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn't turn the way\nthe tailwind is pushing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630158,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, it turns in\nthe opposite direction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632568,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "working like a fan to push air backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635538,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This fan is powered by the wheels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 637598,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which are connected to the\npropeller by a bike chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640328,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So at wind speed, the\ncar can keep accelerating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642988,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the wheels turn the\nfan, which blows air back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646138,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generating forward thrust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648448,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the big question is, to drive the fan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650798,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there must be a backwards\nforce on the wheels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653188,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which tends to slow them down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655138,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why isn't this force bigger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657898,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the thrust from the propeller"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659348,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "causing the car to slow down overall?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661908,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the answer is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663238,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the wheels are going so\nmuch faster over the ground"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666298,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the propeller is\nmoving through the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668358,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the thrust force\ncan actually be larger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670918,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm gonna do an analysis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672248,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the frame of reference of the car."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674398,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the important equation to know is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676088,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "power equals force times velocity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678778,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So at the wheels, power\nis input into the system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681838,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the ground moving underneath the car."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684518,
    "dDurationMs": 2549,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The power generated is the force\nof the ground on the wheels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687067,
    "dDurationMs": 2604,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "times the velocity of the car."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690678,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the propeller, work is done on the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693048,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the propeller pushes it backwards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695428,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The power out equals the\nforce of the prop on the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698718,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "times the speed of the car,\nminus the speed of the wind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702648,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The prop is going slower through the air"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704778,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to the tailwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706348,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if we assume no losses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707968,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the power in at the wheels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709658,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equals the power out at the propeller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711998,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From this equation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712988,
    "dDurationMs": 1737,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can see that the force at the propeller"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714725,
    "dDurationMs": 3513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be greater than\nthe force at the wheels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718238,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since the propeller\nis pushing air back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720365,
    "dDurationMs": 3103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the air applies an\nequal and opposite force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723468,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forward on the prop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725378,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the thrust force,\nwhich will be greater"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727948,
    "dDurationMs": 2103,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the backwards force on the wheels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732038,
    "dDurationMs": 3586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, this car works like\na lever or a pulley"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735624,
    "dDurationMs": 2354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by applying a small force to the wheels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737978,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over a larger distance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739798,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the propeller can apply a larger force"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742032,
    "dDurationMs": 2085,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over a smaller distance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744117,
    "dDurationMs": 2941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is just like when you're\nriding a bike going up hill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747058,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you move the pedals fast,\nbut with smaller force,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750148,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make the wheels move\nslower over the ground,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752409,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but with a bigger force."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755158,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now we've run into the\ndivide by zero problem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 757648,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Professor Kusenko warned us about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760058,
    "dDurationMs": 1010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the speed of the car"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 761068,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is exactly equal to the speed of the wind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763158,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it seems like the propeller\ncan provide infinite force."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766848,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That can't be right, can it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768268,
    "dDurationMs": 2371,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, is our analysis flawed?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770639,
    "dDurationMs": 3289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer is no, for two reasons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773928,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First of all, this is\nexactly what you'd expect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776218,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "theoretically, with any lever or pulley."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778748,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If one arm of the lever is zero,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780618,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you can lift an infinite weight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783098,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with any amount of\nforce on the other side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785388,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The catch is, it's\ndisplacement will be zero."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788898,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But second of all, in practice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790818,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a propeller efficiency term"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792528,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is ill-defined"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793458,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the propeller is not\nmoving through the air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795798,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's a better formula\nfor the prop proficiency,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798328,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is well-defined\nin the zero speed limit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801678,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes an algebraic mess,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803608,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's perfectly well-defined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805148,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And then the divide by\nzero problem is eliminated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808668,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that equation makes the problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810378,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look more complicated than it actually is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812798,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't actually need aerodynamics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815108,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here, I have a little\ncart with a big wheel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817638,
    "dDurationMs": 2548,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that rolls on two smaller spools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820186,
    "dDurationMs": 1791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I'm gonna show"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821977,
    "dDurationMs": 2751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that when you have two media"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824728,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moving relative to one another,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826598,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well then if this car is\nin contact with both media,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829998,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can actually move faster\nthan their relative velocity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835068,
    "dDurationMs": 3991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as I push the board to the right,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839059,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see that the\ncar goes down the board"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842409,
    "dDurationMs": 2192,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "faster than the board is moving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846038,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look carefully,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847178,
    "dDurationMs": 1517,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll see that the big wheel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848695,
    "dDurationMs": 4363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't turning the way that\nthe board is pushing it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853058,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's actually rotating in\nthe opposite direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856098,
    "dDurationMs": 2498,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's just like the\npropeller on Blackbird,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858596,
    "dDurationMs": 3272,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which pushes back against the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861868,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's how it's able to go faster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864158,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the wind downwind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866438,
    "dDurationMs": 3083,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you can build one of these\ncars for yourself at home,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869521,
    "dDurationMs": 4497,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or you can build a model downwind cart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874018,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I told you, Xyla was determined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875738,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I'm gonna make the claim on camera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877838,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I like, I think it's gonna work this time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880488,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're changing the propeller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881321,
    "dDurationMs": 887,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It has to work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882208,
    "dDurationMs": 2323,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before we get kicked out of\nthe treadmill store. (laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884531,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(motors roaring)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893062,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(chuckling)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895392,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Does it work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896225,
    "dDurationMs": 1263,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It totally works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897488,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898838,
    "dDurationMs": 2415,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh my god, it's so good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901253,
    "dDurationMs": 3165,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Her fourth version of the\ncart works spectacularly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904418,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was designed to\nbe replicated by anyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907108,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using just a 3D printer and\na simple list of materials."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910498,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She explains how to\nbuild it with more detail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912498,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the engineering process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913578,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on a video over on her channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915098,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So go check it out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916968,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, professor Kusenko\nhas now conceded the bet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920148,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he transferred $10,000 to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922738,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I wanna thank him for\nbeing a man of honor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924798,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and changing his mind in light\nof the evidence I presented,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928068,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is really not easy to do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929728,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially in a public\ndebate like this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 932228,
    "dDurationMs": 2111,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I do not wanna keep the money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934339,
    "dDurationMs": 2859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanna invest it in\nscience communication."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937198,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm holding a one-minute\nvideo competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940868,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll be awarding cash prizes\nto the top three videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944498,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that explain a\ncounterintuitive STEM concept."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947438,
    "dDurationMs": 3034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll put some details\ndown in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950472,
    "dDurationMs": 1926,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I love about science,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952398,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that disagreements are not problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955438,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are opportunities for\neveryone to learn something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958898,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I learned a lot more about\nBlackbird aerodynamics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962018,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gear ratios than I knew before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964668,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also learned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965501,
    "dDurationMs": 1787,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I should go into\nmore depth in my videos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967288,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should make the evidence\noverwhelmingly convincing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969818,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and put in some equations toward the end"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971548,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for those who want that level of detail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973722,
    "dDurationMs": 3016,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanna thank everyone involved\nin the making this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976738,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Neil deGrasse Tyson, Bill\nNye, Sean Carroll, Mark Drela,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979738,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Professor Kusenko and Xyla Foxlin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982188,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but especially Rick Cavallaro,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984498,
    "dDurationMs": 2005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the inventor and creator of Blackbird."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986503,
    "dDurationMs": 2106,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was a fountain of information,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988609,
    "dDurationMs": 1709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a constant source of support,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990318,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the man leading the charge\nto help people understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992898,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this area of physics\nfor the past 15 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995798,
    "dDurationMs": 2574,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's hope this video\nputs the issue to rest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998372,
    "dDurationMs": 2202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once and for all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000574,
    "dDurationMs": 3322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(electronics buzzing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003896,
    "dDurationMs": 3012,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Blackbird craft all\nstarted with a brain teaser."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006908,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this video sponsor, Brilliant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008441,
    "dDurationMs": 3017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "offers you a daily problem\nto solve every day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011458,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like this one about gear ratios."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013448,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the first gear spins\n10 times per second,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015608,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at what rate does the final gear spin?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017978,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now I did this problem the hard way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019248,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but my wife figured out\nhow to do it the easy way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021758,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what brain\nteasers are great for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023888,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They get you thinking about the world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025328,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they give you insights into problems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027078,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might think you already understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029538,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just think about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030371,
    "dDurationMs": 2232,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much more you would\nunderstand in a year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032603,
    "dDurationMs": 1475,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you got into the habit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034078,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of solving one novel\nunexpected problem per day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037488,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while you're at it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038478,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why not take one of Brilliant's courses,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040188,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like on computer science, neural networks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042308,
    "dDurationMs": 1146,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or classical physics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043454,
    "dDurationMs": 1924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even physics professors can benefit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045378,
    "dDurationMs": 2258,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from some of the lessons\non frames of reference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047636,
    "dDurationMs": 2372,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somehow I managed to go my whole degree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050008,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without learning Lagrangian mechanics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051798,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's a course I'm\nworking through at the moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054728,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a really elegant way\nof solving physics problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057018,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I wish I had learned about it sooner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059668,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For viewers of this channel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060501,
    "dDurationMs": 3257,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant are offering 20%\noff an annual subscription"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063758,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the first 200 people to sign up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066068,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just go to Brilliant.org/Veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1068828,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will put that link\ndown in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070918,
    "dDurationMs": 2317,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I wanna thank Brilliant\nfor supporting Veritasium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073235,
    "dDurationMs": 1916,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I wanna thank you for watching."
    } ]
  } ]
}
